1833
02:23:48,020 --> 02:23:52,580
Pakistan says energy, security and diplomacy cannot be separated.

1834
02:23:52,580 --> 02:23:56,500
And what it is trying to do is to find common ground between the three spheres

1835
02:23:56,580 --> 02:23:59,460
