The straight-up for mums remains open,

2177
02:43:40,830 --> 02:43:42,710
just not to the United States or Israel

2178
02:43:42,710 --> 02:43:44,350
or other countries that Iran determines

2179
02:43:44,350 --> 02:43:45,390
is a threat to them.

2180
02:43:45,390 --> 02:43:47,150
And exclusive reports.

2181
02:43:47,150 --> 02:43:50,270
Human rights groups say emptying whole areas

2182
02:43:50,270 --> 02:43:51,950
