2184
02:43:57,570 --> 02:44:00,210
In-depth analysis of the day's headlines.

2185
02:44:00,210 --> 02:44:04,450
Diplomacy yet again was used as a ruse for war.

2186
02:44:04,450 --> 02:44:05,490
Critical debate.

2187
02:44:05,490 --> 02:44:06,810
Who betrayed the table?

2188
02:44:06,810 --> 02:44:09,610
Who attacked the negotiations for the second time?

2189
02:44:09,610 --> 02:44:11,570
For the third time during the talks

2190
02:44:11,570 --> 02:44:12,570
we should be attacked?

2191
02:44:12,570 --> 02:44:15,570
Who is talking about a greater country for itself?

2192
02:44:15,570 --> 02:44:16,810
Israel, not Iran.

2193
02:44:16,810 --> 02:44:20,730
Iran has been a huge supporter of terrorism over the years.

2194
02:44:20,730 --> 02:44:22,970
I really have to take exception to the idea

2195
02:44:23,050 --> 02:44:24,930
that Iran is innocent in this.

2196
02:44:24,930 --> 02:44:27,690
Inside Story on Al Jazeera.

2197
02:44:27,690 --> 02:44:30,490
This war is escalating and has become a story

2198
02:44:30,490 --> 02:44:35,130
in which propaganda can matter as much as military might does.

2199
02:44:35,130 --> 02:44:37,930
Censorship is taking place across the board.

2200
02:44:37,930 --> 02:44:40,650
Our focus, as always here at the listening post,

2201
02:44:40,650 --> 02:44:41,930
is on the journalism.

2202
02:44:41,930 --> 02:45:08,650
Hello, this is Al Jazeera live from Doha

2203
02:45:08,650 --> 02:45:10,450
with our continuing coverage of the war

2204
02:45:10,450 --> 02:45:12,850
between the US, Israel and Iran.

2205
02:45:12,850 --> 02:45:14,450
I'm Malin Said.

2206
02:45:14,450 --> 02:45:18,250
Coming up, Donald Trump sets a Tuesday deadline for Iran

2207
02:45:18,250 --> 02:45:20,410
