4524
05:33:12,100 --> 05:33:14,700
Hundreds of thousands of Palestinians made homeless

4525
05:33:14,700 --> 05:33:17,820
by Israel's war on Gaza every day is a struggle.

4526
05:33:18,260 --> 05:33:21,220
