4527
05:33:21,220 --> 05:33:24,940
some families are collecting scrap metals to survive.

4528
05:33:25,260 --> 05:33:27,300
Harry Mahmood reports from Gaza City.

4529
05:33:30,900 --> 05:33:32,980
Trucks arrive one after another,

4530
05:33:33,500 --> 05:33:37,260
