06:07:20,790 --> 06:07:22,470
More than 700 have been killed

5229
06:07:22,470 --> 06:07:26,180
since the ceasefire came into effect in October.

5230
06:07:26,180 --> 06:07:31,500
As for raising the issue of weapons in this crude manner,

5231
06:07:31,500 --> 06:07:33,540
it is nothing but a scandalous attempt

5232
06:07:33,540 --> 06:07:36,420
by the occupation to continue killing and genocide

5233
06:07:36,420 --> 06:07:37,700
against our people,

5234
06:07:37,700 --> 06:07:41,020
which we will not accept under any circumstances.

5235
06:07:41,020 --> 06:07:43,860
We affirm that what the enemy was unable to seize from us

5236
06:07:43,860 --> 06:07:45,620
with tanks and genocide,

5237
06:07:45,620 --> 06:07:47,780
it will not seize from us with politics

5238
06:07:47,780 --> 06:07:50,100
or at the negotiation table.

5239
06:07:50,100 --> 06:07:52,260
The occupation's aggression against our people

5240
06:07:52,260 --> 06:07:55,060
and its continued closure of the blessed al-Aqsa mosque

5241
06:07:55,060 --> 06:07:57,500
to worshipers in an unprecedented manner

5242
06:07:57,500 --> 06:07:58,860
and the approval of the law

5243
06:07:58,860 --> 06:08:00,980
for executing Palestinian prisoners,

5244
06:08:00,980 --> 06:08:03,220
we call upon the masses of our Palestinian people

5245
06:08:03,220 --> 06:08:05,780
in the brave West Bank, the blessed Jerusalem

5246
06:08:05,780 --> 06:08:10,660
and the occupied interior to march toward al-Aqsa mosque.

5247
06:08:10,660 --> 06:08:13,300
Mu'in Rabani is a non-resident fellow at the Center

5248
06:08:13,300 --> 06:08:15,380
for Conflicts and Humanitarian Studies.

5249
06:08:15,380 --> 06:08:17,540
He says Hamas's statement confirms

5250
06:08:17,540 --> 06:08:19,380
that talks to implement the second phase

5251
06:08:19,380 --> 06:08:23,330
of the Gaza ceasefire plan are deadlocked.

5252
06:08:23,330 --> 06:08:26,770
What Hamas informed the mediators

5253
06:08:26,770 --> 06:08:29,610
is that it will not discuss issues

5254
06:08:29,610 --> 06:08:33,810
such as disarmament relating to the second phase

5255
06:08:33,810 --> 06:08:36,930
of the plan for the Gaza Strip

5256
06:08:36,930 --> 06:08:41,530
until the items of the first phase are implemented.

5257
06:08:41,530 --> 06:08:43,810
That includes a cessation of hostilities.

5258
06:08:43,810 --> 06:08:47,130
As you noted, virtual daily Israeli attacks

5259
06:08:47,130 --> 06:08:48,690
on the Gaza Strip have resulted

5260
06:08:48,690 --> 06:08:51,370
in more than 700 Palestinians killed.

5261
06:08:51,370 --> 06:08:54,330
Humanitarian aid continues to be restricted.

5262
06:08:54,330 --> 06:08:57,170
And most notably this national committee

5263
06:08:57,170 --> 06:08:59,650
for the administration of the Gaza Strip

5264
06:08:59,650 --> 06:09:03,130
which was established by the Board of Peace

5265
06:09:03,130 --> 06:09:04,690
continues to be prohibited

5266
06:09:04,690 --> 06:09:07,490
from entering the Gaza Strip by the Israelis

5267
06:09:07,490 --> 06:09:10,290
and the Board of Peace is doing absolutely nothing

5268
06:09:10,290 --> 06:09:13,770
to ensure its ability to get in.

5269
06:09:13,770 --> 06:09:16,810
And so I think Hamas is taking two positions.

5270
06:09:16,810 --> 06:09:19,610
A, it won't discuss the second phase

5271
06:09:19,610 --> 06:09:22,530
until the first phase is properly implemented.

5272
06:09:22,530 --> 06:09:25,610
And B, when those discussions do take place,

5273
06:09:25,610 --> 06:09:29,610
it's not going to simply surrender its weapons

5274
06:09:29,690 --> 06:09:35,330
unless Israel clearly meets its own obligations as well.

5275
06:09:35,330 --> 06:09:39,250
And those are obligations that have to be consistent

5276
06:09:39,250 --> 06:09:41,290
not just with what the Board of Peace wants

5277
06:09:41,290 --> 06:09:43,930
but with the international consensus

5278
06:09:43,930 --> 06:09:47,050
and the rulings of the International Court of Justice

5279
06:09:47,050 --> 06:09:51,600
that this is an illegal occupation that must end.

5280
06:09:51,600 --> 06:09:53,520
For hundreds of thousands of Palestinians

5281
06:09:53,520 --> 06:09:55,560
made homeless by Israel's war on Gaza

5282
06:09:55,560 --> 06:09:57,320
every day is a struggle.

5283
06:09:57,320 --> 06:09:58,720
As bombed out neighborhoods

5284
06:09:58,720 --> 06:10:00,560
are slowly cleared of rubble

5285
06:10:00,560 --> 06:10:04,440
some families are collecting scrap metals to survive.

5286
06:10:04,440 --> 06:10:10,160
Annie Mahmood reports from Gaza City.

5287
06:10:10,160 --> 06:10:12,760
Trucks arrive one after another

5288
06:10:12,760 --> 06:10:17,620
offloading what remains of homes, shops and entire streets.

5289
06:10:17,620 --> 06:10:19,500
Across large part of Gaza

5290
06:10:19,500 --> 06:10:21,620
rubble removal continues month after

5291
06:10:21,620 --> 06:10:25,290
Israeli bombardment flat an entire neighborhood.

5292
06:10:25,290 --> 06:10:27,530
But for some these dumping grounds

5293
06:10:27,530 --> 06:10:30,610
are more than just fields of debris.

5294
06:10:30,610 --> 06:10:32,700
They are workplaces.

5295
06:10:32,700 --> 06:10:35,620
Children search the mountains of broken concrete

5296
06:10:35,620 --> 06:10:38,900
and a twisted metal for anything they can sell.

5297
06:10:38,900 --> 06:10:43,060
Wood, copper wire, aluminum.

5298
06:10:43,060 --> 06:10:46,840
Each piece they collect means a few more coins.

5299
06:10:46,840 --> 06:10:52,170
Each truck brings another opportunity and another risk.

5300
06:10:52,170 --> 06:10:54,050
The ground is unstable.

5301
06:10:54,050 --> 06:10:56,850
Sharp edges from broken walls.

5302
06:10:56,850 --> 06:10:59,610
Aid agents is worn unexploded ordinance

5303
06:10:59,610 --> 06:11:03,300
may still be buried beneath the debris.

5304
06:11:03,300 --> 06:11:07,500
Hassan Abdel-A'al lives in a tent near one of the dumping sites.

5305
06:11:07,500 --> 06:11:15,140
We come here hoping to earn 20 shakals, about $6.

5306
06:11:15,140 --> 06:11:16,860
But it comes at a cost.

5307
06:11:16,860 --> 06:11:19,860
Injuries, exhaustion, cuts everywhere.

5308
06:11:19,860 --> 06:11:22,900
You can see the wounds and the blood.

5309
06:11:22,900 --> 06:11:25,500
The war has left hundreds of thousands of families

5310
06:11:25,500 --> 06:11:27,740
without stable income.

5311
06:11:27,740 --> 06:11:30,460
Factories are shut, shops are gone,

5312
06:11:30,460 --> 06:11:33,320
entire businesses reduced to dust.

5313
06:11:33,920 --> 06:11:37,760
Post-war recovery is measured by reconstruction in plans,

5314
06:11:37,760 --> 06:11:39,040
funding, and pledges.

5315
06:11:39,040 --> 06:11:41,800
But here on the ground recovery looks different.

5316
06:11:41,800 --> 06:11:44,800
It looks like children navigating the rubble,

5317
06:11:44,800 --> 06:11:48,080
household depending on the fragments of what was destroyed.

5318
06:11:48,080 --> 06:11:51,560
As long as livelihood remains absent

5319
06:11:51,560 --> 06:11:53,560
and reconstruction uncertain,

5320
06:11:53,560 --> 06:11:57,000
the rubble will continue to serve two purposes.

5321
06:11:57,000 --> 06:11:59,680
One reminder of loss

5322
06:11:59,680 --> 06:12:03,280
and for some people it is a means of survival.

5323
06:12:04,040 --> 06:12:08,520
Informal scrap collection has become one of the few ways to earn cash.

5324
06:12:10,920 --> 06:12:13,200
We come here to earn money for food.

5325
06:12:13,200 --> 06:12:15,920
My father has no work, so we have to come.

5326
06:12:18,240 --> 06:12:21,880
We come here hoping to find bits of wood or pieces of cable

5327
06:12:21,880 --> 06:12:22,920
that we can sell,

5328
06:12:22,920 --> 06:12:25,720
anything that may help us buy food for our children.

5329
06:12:25,720 --> 06:12:29,000
We know climbing onto the moving trucks is dangerous,

5330
06:12:29,000 --> 06:12:32,000
but when your family depends on it, you take the risk.

5331
06:12:33,730 --> 06:12:36,730
Parents say they don't want their children here,

5332
06:12:36,730 --> 06:12:39,730
but survival leaves little room for a choice.

5333
06:12:39,730 --> 06:12:45,080
Hani Mahmoud Al-Jazeera from Gaza City, Palestine.

5334
06:12:46,940 --> 06:12:48,940
Serbia says explosives have been found

5335
06:12:48,940 --> 06:12:52,940
near a pipeline that carries Russian gas to Hungary.

5336
06:12:52,940 --> 06:12:54,940
Authorities say the discovery was made outside

5337
06:12:54,940 --> 06:12:57,940
a Serbian town near the Hungarian border.

5338
06:12:57,940 --> 06:13:01,940
It comes just a week before closely watched elections in Hungary.

5339
06:13:01,940 --> 06:13:03,940
The Prime Minister Viktor Orbán is fighting

5340
06:13:03,940 --> 06:13:05,940
to extend his 16 years in power.

5341
06:13:05,940 --> 06:13:08,940
He's linked Ukraine to those explosives.

5342
06:13:12,040 --> 06:13:15,040
For years, Ukraine has been working to cut Europe off

5343
06:13:15,040 --> 06:13:16,040
from Russian energy.

5344
06:13:16,040 --> 06:13:18,040
They blew up Nord Stream,

5345
06:13:18,040 --> 06:13:21,040
shut down the gas pipeline supplying Hungary,

5346
06:13:21,040 --> 06:13:24,040
and this year placed Hungary under an oil blockade

5347
06:13:24,040 --> 06:13:26,040
by closing the Družba pipeline.

5348
06:13:26,040 --> 06:13:28,040
The Russian section of the Turkstream

5349
06:13:28,040 --> 06:13:30,040
is also under continuous military attack.

5350
06:13:30,040 --> 06:13:33,040
Ukraine's efforts pose a life-threatening danger to Hungary.

5351
06:13:34,040 --> 06:13:37,040
Well, Kiev has rejected Orbán's accusations

5352
06:13:37,040 --> 06:13:40,040
and instead suggested that Russia is to blame.

5353
06:13:40,040 --> 06:13:42,040
In a statement posted to social media,

5354
06:13:42,040 --> 06:13:44,040
Ukraine's Foreign Ministry spokesman

5355
06:13:44,040 --> 06:13:47,040
wrote that his country had nothing to do with the situation.

5356
06:13:47,040 --> 06:13:49,040
He also claims that it was, quote,

5357
06:13:49,040 --> 06:13:52,040
most probably a Russian false flag operation

5358
06:13:52,040 --> 06:13:54,040
as part of Moscow's heavy interference

5359
06:13:54,040 --> 06:13:57,140
in Hungarian elections.

5360
06:13:57,140 --> 06:13:59,140
It's been a subdued Easter

5361
06:13:59,140 --> 06:14:01,140
in the occupied Palestinian territories

5362
06:14:01,140 --> 06:14:03,140
