5364
06:14:05,140 --> 06:14:07,140
A small Sunday mass was held

5365
06:14:07,140 --> 06:14:09,140
at the Church of the Holy Sepulchre

5366
06:14:09,140 --> 06:14:11,140
in occupied East Jerusalem.

5367
06:14:11,140 --> 06:14:13,140
The site is revered by Christians

5368
06:14:13,140 --> 06:14:15,140
as the traditional site of Jesus Christ's

5369
06:14:15,140 --> 06:14:18,140
Crucification and Resurrection.

5370
06:14:18,140 --> 06:14:21,140
Israeli authorities have limited access.

5371
06:14:21,140 --> 06:14:23,140
On Palm Sunday last week,

5372
06:14:23,140 --> 06:14:26,140
