5379
06:14:47,770 --> 06:14:49,930
Worshipers attended mass

5380
06:14:49,930 --> 06:14:53,930
at the St. Peripherious Church in Gaza City.

5381
06:14:53,930 --> 06:14:56,930
It came under Israeli attack several times

5382
06:14:56,930 --> 06:15:01,420
