5391
06:15:22,780 --> 06:15:26,160
Vital shipping lanes choked.

5392
06:15:26,160 --> 06:15:28,160
We strongly encourage other nations

5393
06:15:28,160 --> 06:15:30,160
whose economies depend on this trade

5394
06:15:30,160 --> 06:15:32,160
