5411
06:16:07,900 --> 06:16:11,340
Inside Story on Al Jazeera.

5412
06:16:11,340 --> 06:16:13,340
Is Israel's new death penalty law

5413
06:16:13,340 --> 06:16:15,340
further entrenching apartheid?

5414
06:16:15,340 --> 06:16:17,340
That conversation is coming up.

5415
06:16:17,340 --> 06:16:20,340
But first, Israel continues its attacks in Iran

5416
06:16:20,340 --> 06:16:22,340
and its ground invasion of southern Lebanon

5417
06:16:22,340 --> 06:16:24,340
with civilian casualties mounting

5418
06:16:24,340 --> 06:16:26,340
and the targeted destruction

5419
06:16:26,340 --> 06:16:28,340
of key civilian infrastructure ramping up.

5420
06:16:28,340 --> 06:16:30,340
Is Israel trying to apply

5421
06:16:30,340 --> 06:16:33,340
the Gaza playbook to Lebanon and Iran?

5422
06:16:33,340 --> 06:16:35,340
I'll ask Israel's former Deputy Foreign Minister,

5423
06:16:35,340 --> 06:16:37,340
Danny Ayalon.

5424
06:16:37,340 --> 06:16:45,560
Danny Ayalon, welcome to Up Front.

5425
06:16:45,560 --> 06:16:48,620
Thank you very much, Ridi.

5426
06:16:48,620 --> 06:16:49,620
Thank you.

5427
06:16:49,620 --> 06:16:51,620
So after more than a month of war,

5428
06:16:51,620 --> 06:16:53,620
the Iranian government has not collapsed.

5429
06:16:53,620 --> 06:16:55,620
It is still standing.

5430
06:16:55,620 --> 06:16:57,620
US intelligence assessments are telling us

5431
06:16:57,620 --> 06:16:59,620
that it is unlikely to collapse anytime soon.

5432
06:16:59,620 --> 06:17:01,620
Even your Prime Minister, Benjamin Netanyahu,

5433
06:17:01,620 --> 06:17:03,620
has conceded that regime change

5434
06:17:03,620 --> 06:17:06,620
cannot happen via airstrikes.

5435
06:17:06,620 --> 06:17:08,620
It must happen internally.

5436
06:17:08,620 --> 06:17:11,620
Yet Israel continues to escalate its attacks,

5437
06:17:11,620 --> 06:17:14,620
killing the very people it claims to help.

5438
06:17:14,620 --> 06:17:17,620
What exactly is the point of this war?

5439
06:17:17,620 --> 06:17:21,190
Yes, well, really best that I can tell.

5440
06:17:21,190 --> 06:17:24,190
The idea was not immediately to

5441
06:17:24,190 --> 06:17:27,190
get rid of this murderous regime

5442
06:17:27,190 --> 06:17:29,190
of the Ayatollahs in Tehran,

5443
06:17:29,190 --> 06:17:31,190
but maybe to create the conditions.

5444
06:17:31,190 --> 06:17:33,190
Whether it will happen in weeks or months,

5445
06:17:33,190 --> 06:17:35,190
no one can tell.

5446
06:17:35,190 --> 06:17:38,190
But the purpose of the airstrikes

5447
06:17:38,190 --> 06:17:42,190
of Israel, and then I believe also of the United States,

5448
06:17:42,190 --> 06:17:45,190
is actually to degrade Iran

5449
06:17:45,190 --> 06:17:48,190
to take out the capability that they have built

5450
06:17:48,190 --> 06:17:51,190
of long-range missiles

5451
06:17:51,190 --> 06:17:53,190
that now we are on the receiving end of it.

5452
06:17:53,190 --> 06:17:55,190
By the way, not just Israel.

5453
06:17:55,190 --> 06:17:58,190
It's the entire Gulf countries.

5454
06:17:58,190 --> 06:18:00,190
It's even Turkey and even Cyprus.

5455
06:18:00,190 --> 06:18:02,190
But that's as a result.

5456
06:18:02,190 --> 06:18:04,190
That's as a result of Israel's attack.

5457
06:18:04,190 --> 06:18:06,190
And they were already at the negotiation table.

5458
06:18:06,190 --> 06:18:08,190
All the retaliatory attacks are happening

5459
06:18:08,190 --> 06:18:10,190
because of Israel's attacks.

5460
06:18:10,190 --> 06:18:13,930
Well, unfortunately, we have been watching

5461
06:18:13,930 --> 06:18:19,930
this Iranian regime since 1979.

5462
06:18:19,930 --> 06:18:23,930
And we have seen that they do not live up

5463
06:18:23,930 --> 06:18:26,930
to their promises, not in the nuclear issues,

5464
06:18:26,930 --> 06:18:29,930
that they did everything against their own commitments

5465
06:18:29,930 --> 06:18:32,930
on the non-proliferation treaty

5466
06:18:32,930 --> 06:18:34,930
and also on the missiles.

5467
06:18:34,930 --> 06:18:37,930
We have heard them say time and again

5468
06:18:37,930 --> 06:18:39,930
that they do not have missiles

5469
06:18:39,930 --> 06:18:43,930
which are more than 1,000 or 1,500 kilometers.

5470
06:18:43,930 --> 06:18:45,930
Only two weeks ago, really.

5471
06:18:45,930 --> 06:18:48,930
They fired two ballistic missiles

5472
06:18:48,930 --> 06:18:51,930
towards the island of Diego Garcia

5473
06:18:51,930 --> 06:18:54,930
in the Indian Pacific,

5474
06:18:54,930 --> 06:18:57,930
which is at the range of 4,000.

5475
06:18:57,930 --> 06:19:00,930
So you cannot take them at their word on the contrary.

5476
06:19:00,930 --> 06:19:03,930
This is why we have to watch them very carefully

5477
06:19:03,930 --> 06:19:06,930
and also, they were building

5478
06:19:06,930 --> 06:19:12,930
a massive infrastructure of missiles

5479
06:19:12,930 --> 06:19:17,930
and in their plan was to build 10,000 ballistic missiles

5480
06:19:17,930 --> 06:19:22,930
with a longer range, bigger warheads,

5481
06:19:22,930 --> 06:19:23,930
more accuracy.

5482
06:19:23,930 --> 06:19:26,930
10,000 missiles to be launched on any country

5483
06:19:26,930 --> 06:19:27,930
could be devastating

5484
06:19:27,930 --> 06:19:30,930
and it could be akin to almost a nuclear bomb.

5485
06:19:30,930 --> 06:19:34,930
Iran reportedly removed its limits on ballistic missiles

5486
06:19:34,930 --> 06:19:36,930
only after Israel's bombing campaign

5487
06:19:36,930 --> 06:19:37,930
during the war last year.

5488
06:19:37,930 --> 06:19:40,930
Now, as a result of this new threat,

5489
06:19:40,930 --> 06:19:43,930
hard-line voices within Iran

5490
06:19:43,930 --> 06:19:44,930
are pushing for withdrawal

5491
