7079
08:12:30,690 --> 08:12:36,370
Because in many modern conflicts, victory is no longer the only or even the main objective.

7080
08:12:36,370 --> 08:12:40,050
Wars today don't just destroy, they also produce.

7081
08:12:40,050 --> 08:12:46,050
