7816
08:58:40,330 --> 08:58:42,450
and the paramedics who have been killed,

7817
08:58:42,450 --> 08:58:47,130
we are talking about roughly 25% of the casualty toll.

7818
08:58:47,130 --> 08:58:50,170
All right, Zaina, and while we have you,

7819
08:58:50,170 --> 08:58:51,930
let's talk about where Israel is

7820
08:58:51,930 --> 08:58:55,170
in terms of its ground invasion in southern Lebanon.

7821
08:58:55,170 --> 08:59:01,560
What are they saying right now about it?

7822
08:59:01,560 --> 08:59:03,560
Well, the Israeli military

7823
08:59:03,560 --> 08:59:05,560
is operating in southern Lebanon,

7824
08:59:05,560 --> 08:59:07,840
but in the past 24, 48 hours,

7825
08:59:07,840 --> 08:59:11,080
they haven't made any significant military gains

7826
08:59:11,080 --> 08:59:12,080
on the ground.

7827
08:59:12,080 --> 08:59:14,560
Yes, they have territorial control

7828
08:59:14,560 --> 08:59:17,160
of some areas along that border,

7829
08:59:17,160 --> 08:59:20,160
but territorial control does not mean operational control

7830
08:59:20,160 --> 08:59:22,800
because Hezbollah continues to fight back.

7831
08:59:22,800 --> 08:59:24,640
It is putting up resistance.

7832
08:59:24,640 --> 08:59:27,080
And then we heard from the Israeli chief of staff

7833
08:59:27,080 --> 08:59:28,800
on Sunday, where he said,

7834
08:59:28,800 --> 08:59:32,880
yes, Israel's ultimate goal is to disarm Hezbollah,

7835
08:59:32,880 --> 08:59:35,040
but the goal of the current campaign

7836
08:59:35,040 --> 08:59:37,240
is about advancing this goal.

7837
08:59:37,240 --> 08:59:39,160
He does not use the word achieve.

7838
08:59:39,160 --> 08:59:41,280
He uses the word advance.

7839
08:59:41,280 --> 08:59:45,560
And he also calls on the political leadership to play a part.

7840
08:59:45,560 --> 08:59:47,680
So this is the Israeli army saying that

7841
08:59:47,680 --> 08:59:50,400
even though they reach up until the Letani River,

7842
08:59:50,400 --> 08:59:52,480
the stated goal of this invasion,

7843
08:59:52,480 --> 08:59:55,000
it's not going to achieve Hezbollah's disarmament.

7844
08:59:55,000 --> 08:59:56,760
The Israeli military knows very well

7845
08:59:56,760 --> 08:59:59,200
that Hezbollah's strategic infrastructure

7846
08:59:59,200 --> 09:00:00,200
and strategic weapons

7847
09:00:00,000 --> 09:00:06,560
happens, is up in the Bekaa Valley, in the Baalbek area, that's in the east of the country.

7848
09:00:06,560 --> 09:00:11,920
So taking control of the south of Lytani is not going to stop rocket fire.

7849
09:00:11,920 --> 09:00:15,480
And Hezbollah is promising to put up a fight.

7850
09:00:15,480 --> 09:00:20,200
And yesterday, Hezbollah saying that the only way to bring calm to southern Lebanon

7851
09:00:20,200 --> 09:00:25,800
is for Israel to withdraw from that area, responding to the president, who again called

7852
09:00:25,800 --> 09:00:31,720
for negotiations, saying negotiations does not amount to surrender, which is a message to Hezbollah.

7853
09:00:31,720 --> 09:00:36,120
So no end in sight. The Israeli military's advance has been

7854
09:00:36,120 --> 09:00:38,920
slow, with Hezbollah putting up resistance.

7855
09:00:38,920 --> 09:00:43,160
And once again, as you were reporting, Zana civilians there caught in the crossfire.

7856
09:00:43,160 --> 09:00:45,800
Zana Hodor live for us in Beirut. Thank you.

7857
09:00:47,210 --> 09:00:51,050
At least two people have been killed by an Iranian strike in the city of Haifa,

7858
09:00:51,050 --> 09:00:53,610
according to the Fire and Rescue Service.

7859
09:00:53,610 --> 09:00:57,130
A residential building was hit and partially collapsed.

7860
09:00:57,130 --> 09:00:59,290
At least four others have been wounded.

7861
09:00:59,290 --> 09:01:03,290
Emergency teams are searching for two others missing in the rubble.

7862
09:01:03,930 --> 09:01:07,530
Nidda Ibrahim joins us now from Ramallah in the occupied West Bank.

7863
09:01:07,530 --> 09:01:09,210
Nidda, it wasn't just Haifa overnight.

7864
09:01:09,210 --> 09:01:11,850
There have been multiple attacks across Israel.

7865
09:01:11,850 --> 09:01:13,050
What can you tell us about them?

7866
09:01:16,950 --> 09:01:18,630
Not really. These attacks continue.

7867
09:01:18,630 --> 09:01:23,110
And just in the last few minutes, we heard thoughts here after interceptors of work

7868
09:01:23,110 --> 09:01:28,230
to stop an attack that was coming from Iran that was targeting southern Israel,

7869
09:01:28,230 --> 09:01:29,990
including areas in the Dead Sea.

7870
09:01:29,990 --> 09:01:35,990
This was considered the fifth salvo to be sent from Iran into Israel since midnight.

7871
09:01:35,990 --> 09:01:39,590
It focused more on the center of the country,

7872
09:01:39,590 --> 09:01:43,990
where Tel Aviv has been suffering from damage to the buildings.

7873
09:01:43,990 --> 09:01:46,870
No casualties, according to the Israeli Ambulance Service.

7874
09:01:46,870 --> 09:01:51,110
But two salvos, one of them hit the south and the other was targeting

7875
09:01:51,110 --> 09:01:52,070
northern Israel.

7876
09:01:52,070 --> 09:01:56,150
But in general, we are talking about these cluster munitions,

7877
09:01:56,150 --> 09:01:59,590
these fragmenting warheads that have caused damage in Tel Aviv,

7878
09:01:59,590 --> 09:02:01,270
according to the Israeli sources.

7879
09:02:01,270 --> 09:02:04,710
It seems that we are looking at an intensification of rockets,

7880
09:02:04,710 --> 09:02:09,270
maybe because there has been some attempt by the Israeli home front

7881
09:02:09,270 --> 09:02:14,630
to ease restrictions in certain areas that they say have suffered less and less attacks.

7882
09:02:14,630 --> 09:02:17,270
So they wanted to resume education.

7883
09:02:17,270 --> 09:02:19,910
This is something that we've seen happen before.

7884
09:02:19,910 --> 09:02:22,870
And when the Israeli home front eased restrictions,

7885
09:02:22,870 --> 09:02:27,590
the Iranians intensified attacks as a way to disrupt normal life in Israel

7886
09:02:27,590 --> 09:02:31,110
and continue to impose kind of pressure on the government

7887
09:02:31,110 --> 09:02:33,350
through keeping the population in their homes,

7888
09:02:33,350 --> 09:02:35,750
not being able to conduct their daily lives.

7889
09:02:35,750 --> 09:02:39,190
Although these people are trying to push back,

7890
09:02:39,190 --> 09:02:41,190
and we've seen yesterday how an Israeli court

7891
09:02:41,190 --> 09:02:43,830
tried to ease restrictions when it comes to worshipers

7892
09:02:43,830 --> 09:02:46,470
going to the western wall in Jerusalem.

7893
09:02:46,470 --> 09:02:49,830
Now this has been deemed by many here as a double standard.

7894
09:02:49,910 --> 09:02:53,750
Because how come the Palestinians who were celebrating Easter yesterday

7895
09:02:53,750 --> 09:02:56,870
were not able to get into the Holy Sepulchre Church?

7896
09:02:56,870 --> 09:02:59,350
The ceremony was only limited to 15 people,

7897
09:02:59,350 --> 09:03:02,870
while at the same time Israelis are being granted through the court

7898
09:03:02,870 --> 09:03:06,390
permissions to pray up to 100 people.

7899
09:03:06,390 --> 09:03:09,110
This is something that has been widely criticized here

7900
09:03:09,110 --> 09:03:11,910
as the country still faces these rocket attacks

7901
09:03:11,910 --> 09:03:14,630
and barrages from Iran at the same time,

7902
09:03:14,630 --> 09:03:18,630
sometimes coordinated attacks come from Hezbollah's side.

7903
09:03:18,630 --> 09:03:22,310
Nidda Ibrahim reporting live for us from Ramallah in the Occupied West Bank.

7904
09:03:22,310 --> 09:03:22,950
Thanks, Nidda.

7905
09:03:24,490 --> 09:03:27,130
The Iran War is piling pressure on Sri Lanka,

7906
09:03:27,130 --> 09:03:30,810
which is still recovering from an economic meltdown four years ago.

7907
09:03:30,810 --> 09:03:34,650
The government has just raised gas prices by 20 percent.

7908
09:03:34,650 --> 09:03:36,730
Petrol and diesel are being rationed,

7909
09:03:36,730 --> 09:03:39,770
and electricity costs are up 25 percent.

7910
09:03:39,770 --> 09:03:43,770
Those surging prices have left many Sri Lankans struggling to get by.

7911
09:03:43,770 --> 09:03:45,770
Manel Fernandez reports from Colombo.

7912
09:03:46,860 --> 09:03:51,260
Lassit Gayan has worked for a food delivery company in Colombo for four years.

7913
09:03:51,260 --> 09:03:55,660
The 39-year-old's income depends on the number of deliveries he makes.

7914
09:03:55,660 --> 09:03:59,660
But restrictions on fuel and price increases caused by the Iran War

7915
09:03:59,660 --> 09:04:01,660
have affected his earnings.

7916
09:04:03,660 --> 09:04:05,900
I make around $20 a day, but I have to buy all my meals.

7917
09:04:05,900 --> 09:04:07,660
That costs more than $5 a day.

7918
09:04:07,660 --> 09:04:11,660
I use what's left for fuel, rent, and to send home to my family.

7919
09:04:12,310 --> 09:04:16,550
Restaurants like this, where Gayan is picking up his first order for the day,

7920
09:04:16,550 --> 09:04:18,070
are also struggling.

7921
09:04:18,070 --> 09:04:19,990
Gas for cooking is more expensive.

7922
09:04:20,870 --> 09:04:23,350
And manager Suranga Thirunagama says

7923
09:04:23,350 --> 09:04:26,070
good quality ingredients are difficult to find.

7924
09:04:27,130 --> 09:04:30,570
This has forced many outlets to increase their prices.

7925
09:04:30,570 --> 09:04:33,290
Something Thirunagama says he's trying to avoid.

7926
09:04:35,130 --> 09:04:37,770
We're trying our best to manage without raising prices,

7927
09:04:37,770 --> 09:04:40,090
but it's getting more challenging day by day,

7928
09:04:40,090 --> 09:04:42,410
because today's prices are not the same tomorrow.

7929
09:04:42,410 --> 09:04:44,730
We can't budget. Prices are increasing.

7930
09:04:45,820 --> 09:04:47,580
And it's already evident.

7931
09:04:47,580 --> 09:04:50,300
Gayan says he's delivering fuel orders these days.

7932
09:04:51,100 --> 09:04:55,100
Many people we spoke to told us the worst part is the uncertainty.

7933
09:04:55,820 --> 09:04:58,140
On the way to his next pickup, Gayan fills up.

7934
09:04:58,780 --> 09:05:01,020
The government has imposed fuel restrictions.

7935
09:05:01,580 --> 09:05:05,340
Motorbike riders get a weekly quota of eight liters.

7936
09:05:05,340 --> 09:05:07,980
Half the fuel Gayan says he usually goes through.

7937
09:05:08,620 --> 09:05:12,460
Station owner Sampat Kotalavala is also dealing with uncertainty.

7938
09:05:15,260 --> 09:05:18,300
We only receive about 50% of the supplies we order.

7939
09:05:18,300 --> 09:05:21,820
And we manage these stocks according to the framework the government has given us.

7940
09:05:21,820 --> 09:05:24,860
It's not enough for some, but generally it's okay.

7941
09:05:24,860 --> 09:05:27,420
But that's for today. I can't say what tomorrow will be like.

7942
09:05:28,950 --> 09:05:30,230
There are other pressures too.

7943
09:05:31,110 --> 09:05:34,790
A long pending electricity price increase took effect this month,

7944
09:05:34,790 --> 09:05:37,190
with some bills set to go up by 25%.

7945
09:05:37,350 --> 09:05:41,770
The government has asked people to use power sparingly.

7946
09:05:41,770 --> 09:05:45,130
Ioning and washing clothes only once a week.

7947
09:05:45,130 --> 09:05:49,130
And government officers have been told to switch off air conditioners early.

7948
09:05:49,770 --> 09:05:53,530
Just as Sri Lanka is recovering from its worst economic crisis,

7949
09:05:53,530 --> 09:05:56,410
the Iran war is causing more uncertainty.

7950
09:05:56,410 --> 09:06:00,810
People are paying more for fuel, food and even public transport

7951
09:06:00,810 --> 09:06:04,810
as a conflict thousands of kilometers away since prices soaring.

7952
09:06:05,530 --> 09:06:09,290
On the road, Gayan has stopped for a cup of tea and a snack

7953
09:06:09,290 --> 09:06:12,250
that's costing him more now than it did two weeks ago.

7954
09:06:12,970 --> 09:06:15,930
But he must hurry because the next order is waiting.

7955
09:06:16,490 --> 09:06:18,970
Menel Fernandez, Al Jazeera, Colombo.

7956
09:06:27,620 --> 09:06:30,660
Let's take a look at some of the world's other news now.

7957
09:06:30,660 --> 09:06:34,900
In the Gaza Strip, Hamas says it will not hand over its weapons.

7958
09:06:34,900 --> 09:06:39,140
Disarmament is part of the second phase of the Gaza ceasefire plan.

7959
09:06:39,140 --> 09:06:42,660
But the armed group says calls to lay down its weapons are unacceptable.

7960
09:06:42,740 --> 09:06:46,500
Especially as Palestinians continue to be targeted by Israel.

7961
09:06:46,500 --> 09:06:51,060
More than 700 people have been killed since the ceasefire came into effect in October.

7962
09:06:54,340 --> 09:06:57,300
As for raising the issue of weapons in this crude manner,

7963
09:06:57,300 --> 09:07:00,260
it is nothing but a scandalous attempt by the occupation

7964
09:07:00,260 --> 09:07:03,460
to continue killing and genocide against our people,

7965
09:07:03,460 --> 09:07:06,100
which we will not accept under any circumstances.

7966
09:07:06,820 --> 09:07:09,700
We affirm that what the enemy was unable to seize from us

7967
09:07:09,700 --> 09:07:12,660
with tanks and genocide, it will not seize from us

7968
09:07:12,660 --> 09:07:15,860
with politics or at the negotiation table.

7969
09:07:15,860 --> 09:07:18,100
The occupation's aggression against our people

7970
09:07:18,100 --> 09:07:20,820
and its continued closure of the blessed Al Aqsa Mosque

7971
09:07:20,820 --> 09:07:23,300
to worshipers in an unprecedented manner

7972
09:07:23,300 --> 09:07:26,740
and the approval of the law for executing Palestinian prisoners,

7973
09:07:26,740 --> 09:07:29,060
we call upon the masses of our Palestinian people

7974
09:07:29,060 --> 09:07:31,540
in the brave West Bank, the blessed Jerusalem,

7975
09:07:31,540 --> 09:07:34,820
and the occupied interior to march toward Al Aqsa Mosque.

7976
09:07:35,850 --> 09:07:40,890
Mohin Rabani is a non-resident fellow at the Center for Conflict and Humanitarian Studies.

7977
09:07:40,890 --> 09:07:44,170
He said Hamas's statements confirms that talks to implement

7978
09:07:44,170 --> 09:07:47,530
the second phase of the Gaza ceasefire plan are deadlocked.

7979
09:07:48,780 --> 09:07:55,100
What Hamas informed the mediators is that it will not discuss issues

7980
09:07:55,100 --> 09:08:02,460
such as disarmament relating to the second phase of the plan for the Gaza Strip

7981
09:08:02,460 --> 09:08:06,940
until the items of the first phase are implemented.

7982
09:08:06,940 --> 09:08:09,180
That includes a cessation of hostilities.

7983
09:08:09,180 --> 09:08:13,420
As you noted, virtual daily Israeli attacks on the Gaza Strip

7984
09:08:13,420 --> 09:08:16,700
have resulted in more than 700 Palestinians killed.

7985
09:08:16,700 --> 09:08:19,180
Humanitarian aid continues to be restricted.

7986
09:08:19,820 --> 09:08:25,100
And most notably, this National Committee for the Administration of the Gaza Strip,

7987
09:08:25,100 --> 09:08:27,980
which was established by the Board of Peace,

7988
09:08:28,540 --> 09:08:32,860
continues to be prohibited from entering the Gaza Strip by the Israelis,

7989
09:08:32,860 --> 09:08:38,620
and the Board of Peace is doing absolutely nothing to ensure its ability to get in.

7990
09:08:39,180 --> 09:08:42,140
And so I think Hamas is taking two positions.

7991
09:08:42,140 --> 09:08:47,900
A, it won't discuss the second phase until the first phase is properly implemented.

7992
09:08:47,900 --> 09:08:50,380
And B, when those discussions do take place,

7993
09:08:51,020 --> 09:08:55,020
it's not going to simply surrender its weapons

7994
09:08:55,100 --> 09:09:00,700
unless Israel clearly meets its own obligations as well.

7995
09:09:00,700 --> 09:09:03,980
And those are obligations that have to be consistent,

7996
09:09:04,620 --> 09:09:06,620
not just with what the Board of Peace wants,

7997
09:09:06,620 --> 09:09:12,380
but with the international consensus and the rulings of the International Court of Justice

7998
09:09:12,380 --> 09:09:15,260
that this is an illegal occupation that must end.

7999
09:09:16,220 --> 09:09:19,660
One of China's leading arts universities has scrapped degrees

8000
09:09:19,660 --> 09:09:22,540
in subjects like translation and photography.

8001
09:09:22,620 --> 09:09:27,180
It says there are a waste of national resources in the age of artificial intelligence.

8002
09:09:27,180 --> 09:09:32,300
But the decision is fueling debate online about how far technology should reshape education.

8003
09:09:32,300 --> 09:09:33,900
Katrina Yew reports from Beijing.

8004
09:09:36,250 --> 09:09:39,210
Alex Scher built her career in the creative industries

8005
09:09:39,210 --> 09:09:43,050
after graduating with a degree in English translation and interpreting.

8006
09:09:43,050 --> 09:09:46,570
But qualifications like hers could soon disappear.

8007
09:09:46,570 --> 09:09:48,810
As some of China's biggest universities,

8008
09:09:48,810 --> 09:09:52,970
cut courses they say are being overtaken by artificial intelligence.

8009
09:09:53,690 --> 09:09:57,930
Alex says the move risks overlooking the broader skills behind translation

8010
09:09:57,930 --> 09:10:00,170
from communication to critical thinking.

8011
09:10:00,730 --> 09:10:02,010
When you translate for sure,

8012
09:10:02,570 --> 09:10:09,130
yes AI could probably get the accuracy up to almost close to perfection.

8013
09:10:09,130 --> 09:10:14,810
But there's still that personal style that's always been essential in translation

8014
09:10:14,810 --> 09:10:16,090
and when it comes to interpreting.

8015
09:10:16,730 --> 09:10:18,490
It's not just translation.

8016
09:10:18,490 --> 09:10:23,770
Degrees in photography, illustration and fashion design are also being scrapped

8017
09:10:23,770 --> 09:10:28,010
with universities saying the future lies in human machine cooperation.

8018
09:10:28,730 --> 09:10:32,090
The changes are part of a broader government push to steer students

8019
09:10:32,090 --> 09:10:35,770
towards industries it considers critical to the country's future

8020
09:10:35,770 --> 09:10:39,530
including robotics, semiconductors and artificial intelligence.

8021
09:10:40,550 --> 09:10:42,070
The pressure is growing.

8022
09:10:42,070 --> 09:10:45,350
More than 12 million students graduated in China last year,

8023
09:10:45,430 --> 09:10:49,030
a record number, and many are struggling to find jobs

8024
09:10:49,030 --> 09:10:52,070
highlighting a mismatch between skills and demand.

8025
09:10:52,070 --> 09:10:55,350
But AI is also creating new opportunities.

8026
09:10:55,350 --> 09:10:58,870
In the film and creative sectors, new roles are emerging

8027
09:10:58,870 --> 09:11:01,910
like prompt engineers and AI animators.

8028
09:11:02,790 --> 09:11:08,070
Before AI, it could take a month just to design characters or scenes.

8029
09:11:08,070 --> 09:11:11,270
Now we can complete an entire project in a month.

8030
09:11:11,910 --> 09:11:16,870
Universities are trying to adapt, launching new programs that combine creative training

8031
09:11:16,870 --> 09:11:17,990
with AI skills.

8032
09:11:18,710 --> 09:11:23,030
Alex says it's more important than ever for young people to diversify their skills.

8033
09:11:23,030 --> 09:11:25,590
She cites stand-up comedy among her own.

8034
09:11:27,270 --> 09:11:33,030
It's just the case that we're in this ever changing and ever changing faster time period

8035
09:11:33,030 --> 09:11:36,550
of human history and we just have to be ready.

8036
09:11:36,550 --> 09:11:37,750
It's just not those days anymore.

8037
09:11:37,750 --> 09:11:40,710
We can put our all of our eggs in one basket.

8038
09:11:40,710 --> 09:11:45,110
But she says one thing still matters, the human touch.

8039
09:11:45,110 --> 09:11:47,270
Katrina Yu, Al-Dazeera, Beijing.

8040
09:11:48,500 --> 09:11:52,020
Up next, Inside Story takes a look at how the war in Iran

8041
09:11:52,020 --> 09:11:55,300
is deepening the humanitarian crisis in Gaza.

8042
09:11:55,300 --> 09:11:58,660
I'll be back in about 30 minutes with our continued coverage of the war

8043
09:11:58,660 --> 09:12:01,220
between the U.S., Israel, and Iran.

8044
09:12:01,220 --> 09:12:04,020
Stay with us. We'll be back after a short break.

8045
09:12:04,020 --> 09:12:08,730
The conflict is arising because of Israel's insistence

8046
09:12:08,730 --> 09:12:11,850
on striking oil facilities inside Iran.

8047
09:12:11,850 --> 09:12:17,450
This is one of the oil facilities of the country that has been targeted.

8048
09:12:17,450 --> 09:12:19,050
You can see the puff of cloud.

8049
09:12:19,050 --> 09:12:22,970
Once those interceptors take out those missiles and rockets and drones.

8050
09:12:22,970 --> 09:12:28,330
Hezbollah rockets have reached this far into Israeli territory and Israel.

8051
09:12:28,330 --> 09:12:30,650
Consider this a serious escalation.

8052
09:12:30,650 --> 09:12:35,210
Lebanon's government is struggling to meet the demand for emergency shelter.

8053
09:12:35,210 --> 09:12:39,370
This stadium is being converted into a mini tent city.

8054
09:12:39,370 --> 09:12:42,570
Stay with Al-Dazeera for the latest developments.

8055
09:12:42,570 --> 09:12:48,900
