10:50:40,700 --> 10:50:42,900
and several intercepting missiles

9411
10:50:42,900 --> 10:50:46,340
tried to stop it from attacking this building,

9412
10:50:46,340 --> 10:50:48,260
but indeed it still did that.

9413
10:50:48,260 --> 10:50:50,220
When we talk about the south of the country,

9414
10:50:50,220 --> 10:50:55,220
near Dimona, which is where the nuclear Israeli facility is,

9415
10:50:55,220 --> 10:50:57,860
they've seen major damage several times,

9416
10:50:57,860 --> 10:51:00,860
one time causing damage to hundreds of homes

9417
10:51:00,860 --> 10:51:02,540
causing people to be displaced,

9418
10:51:02,540 --> 10:51:04,780
but also we're talking about another hit yesterday

9419
10:51:04,780 --> 10:51:07,460
that hit a factory the third time

9420
10:51:07,460 --> 10:51:12,140
since this version of this battle started

9421
10:51:12,140 --> 10:51:17,140
between the Israel and between Israel, the US and Iran.

9422
10:51:17,580 --> 10:51:20,700
We need to remember that these hits

9423
10:51:20,700 --> 10:51:24,740
are sometimes affecting strategic assets inside Israel,

9424
10:51:24,740 --> 10:51:27,860
but because of the tough and strict military censorship,

9425
10:51:27,860 --> 10:51:30,460
we know little about what happens there

9426
10:51:30,460 --> 10:51:34,020
because this is part of the war Israel is trying to wage,

9427
10:51:34,020 --> 10:51:37,380
a psychological aspect to try and keep the population

9428
10:51:37,380 --> 10:51:38,860
supporting this war.

9429
10:51:38,860 --> 10:51:40,580
And in the beginning, we were reporting

9430
10:51:40,580 --> 10:51:43,060
of this high support of this war

9431
10:51:43,060 --> 10:51:47,020
amounting to almost 80% of people saying in polls

9432
10:51:47,020 --> 10:51:48,500
that they support this war,

9433
10:51:48,500 --> 10:51:51,420
this is something that they see as an existential threat.

9434
10:51:51,420 --> 10:51:54,940
But as the war goes on and as these war goals

9435
10:51:54,940 --> 10:51:57,500
that Netanyahu has promised his people

9436
10:51:57,500 --> 10:51:58,780
are not being achieved,

9437
10:51:58,780 --> 10:52:01,460
it's taking much longer than had been anticipated

9438
10:52:01,460 --> 10:52:03,740
and that's the ultimate fear for many Israelis,

9439
10:52:03,740 --> 10:52:04,580
a war of attrition.

9440
10:52:04,580 --> 10:52:07,180
They know that Iran can stand for a long time.

9441
10:52:07,180 --> 10:52:09,500
It has prepared itself for a long war,

9442
10:52:09,500 --> 10:52:11,860
but can the Israelis handle that?

9443
10:52:11,860 --> 10:52:14,540
We have calls from certain opposition leaders

9444
10:52:14,540 --> 10:52:17,300
saying that education needs to go back,

9445
10:52:17,300 --> 10:52:20,780
that they need to try and resort some normalcy

9446
10:52:20,780 --> 10:52:22,500
so people can go on with their lives

9447
10:52:22,500 --> 10:52:24,780
despite these continued strikes.

9448
10:52:24,780 --> 10:52:26,580
Nitta, it's really interesting what you bring up

9449
10:52:26,580 --> 10:52:27,980
about the support for the war,

9450
10:52:27,980 --> 10:52:30,340
which isn't as high today five weeks in

9451
10:52:30,340 --> 10:52:32,180
as it was at the very beginning.

9452
10:52:32,180 --> 10:52:35,300
You were mentioning 80% support for the war in Israel.

9453
10:52:35,300 --> 10:52:36,500
That was five weeks ago,

9454
10:52:36,500 --> 10:52:38,700
but since then, as you also reported,

9455
10:52:38,700 --> 10:52:42,420
people have been going in and out of their shelters

9456
10:52:42,460 --> 10:52:44,740
and their bunkers as missiles rain down on Israel,

9457
10:52:44,740 --> 10:52:45,620
and it's more than that.

9458
10:52:45,620 --> 10:52:47,300
I understand that some people are now living

9459
10:52:47,300 --> 10:52:49,820
in those shelters rather than just occasionally

9460
10:52:49,820 --> 10:52:51,220
going into them.

9461
10:52:51,220 --> 10:52:55,180
So I don't know if it's possible to measure the patience

9462
10:52:55,180 --> 10:52:58,620
that Israelis might still have with this war,

9463
10:52:58,620 --> 10:53:01,540
but what are the indications in terms of

9464
10:53:01,540 --> 10:53:03,540
how much of a runway they're willing

9465
10:53:03,540 --> 10:53:09,620
to give their government to continue this war?

9466
10:53:09,620 --> 10:53:11,020
Well, that's the tough question.

9467
10:53:11,020 --> 10:53:13,180
How long can they handle?

9468
10:53:13,180 --> 10:53:15,660
And we know that when protests have happened

9469
10:53:15,660 --> 10:53:16,820
during the Gaza war,

9470
10:53:16,820 --> 10:53:20,220
Netanyahu paid little attention to the streets anger,

9471
10:53:20,220 --> 10:53:25,220
the streets calls for him to end the war sooner than he did.

9472
10:53:25,460 --> 10:53:28,500
But this time we're also seeing a similar wave

9473
10:53:28,500 --> 10:53:31,980
of more Israelis feeling, are we waging a war

9474
10:53:31,980 --> 10:53:35,260
because Netanyahu wants to win the next elections?

9475
10:53:35,260 --> 10:53:38,020
We know that his government is one of the few

9476
10:53:38,020 --> 10:53:41,660
in the history of Israel to complete its full term

9477
10:53:41,660 --> 10:53:44,620
and we expect it to hand over power

9478
10:53:44,620 --> 10:53:47,220
when the elections take place later this year.

9479
10:53:47,220 --> 10:53:49,380
But Netanyahu is not ready to give up just yet.

9480
10:53:49,380 --> 10:53:50,900
He wants to win these seats

9481
10:53:50,900 --> 10:53:54,540
and he also wants to avoid his corruption trials.

9482
10:53:54,540 --> 10:53:57,660
So he's pushing for a continuation of the war,

9483
10:53:57,660 --> 10:53:59,300
saying he has more bank of targets,

9484
10:53:59,300 --> 10:54:00,900
he has more strikes to do in Iran,

9485
10:54:00,900 --> 10:54:03,340
and that he did not give up on the main goal

9486
10:54:03,340 --> 10:54:04,780
of changing the regime,

9487
10:54:04,780 --> 10:54:06,180
but that did not get achieved.

9488
10:54:06,180 --> 10:54:08,460
And Israelis find themselves going to shelters,

9489
10:54:08,460 --> 10:54:10,100
as you say, sometimes living in them

9490
10:54:10,100 --> 10:54:12,700
because of the continued sirens blasting,

9491
10:54:12,700 --> 10:54:15,020
not just from Iraq, but also from Hezbollah,

9492
10:54:15,020 --> 10:54:17,380
which according to Israeli army officials,

9493
10:54:17,380 --> 10:54:20,180
they've been underestimating the power of Hezbollah.

9494
10:54:20,180 --> 10:54:21,900
So that's a very sensitive issue

9495
10:54:21,900 --> 10:54:23,820
and there are more Israelis who believe

9496
10:54:23,820 --> 10:54:27,420
that they are waging a war to help Netanyahu standing

9497
10:54:27,420 --> 10:54:30,580
and that is not sitting very well with many of them.

9498
10:54:30,580 --> 10:54:32,420
Nida Abraham reporting from Ramallah

9499
10:54:32,420 --> 10:54:33,420
in the occupied West Bank.

9500
10:54:33,420 --> 10:54:36,340
Thank you very much, Nida.

9501
10:54:36,340 --> 10:54:37,980
The threat of escalation in Iran

9502
10:54:37,980 --> 10:54:40,260
has put the Gulf region squarely

9503
10:54:40,260 --> 10:54:41,820
in the crossfire as well.

9504
10:54:41,820 --> 10:54:43,740
In the United Arab Emirates capital,

9505
10:54:43,740 --> 10:54:45,620
one person was injured after debris

9506
10:54:45,620 --> 10:54:48,940
from an intercepted missile fell in an industrial area.

9507
10:54:48,940 --> 10:54:50,580
And the Saudi defense ministry says

9508
10:54:50,580 --> 10:54:52,020
that two drones have been intercepted

9509
10:54:52,020 --> 10:54:54,540
and destroyed in just the past few hours.

9510
10:54:54,540 --> 10:54:57,340
Al Jazeera's Malik Trena is in Kuwait city.

9511
10:54:57,340 --> 10:54:58,980
Malik, you're monitoring developments

9512
10:54:58,980 --> 10:55:00,860
really across the region, across the Gulf.

9513
10:55:00,860 --> 10:55:05,740
What are you seeing today?

9514
10:55:05,740 --> 10:55:10,300
Well, in the UAE, zero authorities in Fujairah

9515
10:55:10,300 --> 10:55:12,300
said they were responding to an incident

9516
10:55:12,300 --> 10:55:14,660
at a telecommunications company.

9517
10:55:14,660 --> 10:55:18,540
You know, the debris from these interceptions,

9518
10:55:18,540 --> 10:55:20,140
what we've learned here in the Gulf

9519
10:55:20,140 --> 10:55:23,140
can be very dangerous and sometimes deadly.

9520
10:55:23,140 --> 10:55:27,420
In the UAE, you know, numerous people have died.

9521
10:55:27,420 --> 10:55:31,260
Due from the debris shrapnel, from these interceptions.

9522
10:55:31,260 --> 10:55:34,860
You know, you mentioned the industrial city in Abu Dhabi

9523
10:55:34,860 --> 10:55:36,140
where one person was injured.

9524
10:55:36,140 --> 10:55:38,060
He was a Ghanaian national.

9525
10:55:38,060 --> 10:55:41,180
And we've seen attacks also across the region.

9526
10:55:41,180 --> 10:55:43,660
You know, in Saudi Arabia, the Ministry of Defense,

9527
10:55:43,660 --> 10:55:45,980
they're saying they intercepted two drones

9528
10:55:45,980 --> 10:55:47,180
in the last couple of hours.

9529
10:55:47,180 --> 10:55:50,300
And here in Kuwait, we woke up to the alarms

9530
10:55:50,300 --> 10:55:52,340
being sounded numerous times.

9531
10:55:52,340 --> 10:55:57,100
So these attacks on the Gulf continue.

9532
10:55:57,100 --> 10:55:59,740
Malik, question specifically on Kuwait,

9533
10:55:59,740 --> 10:56:01,740
because yesterday you were reporting on this,

9534
10:56:01,740 --> 10:56:03,300
Kuwait was really badly hit

9535
10:56:03,300 --> 10:56:05,380
and that included critical infrastructure,

9536
10:56:05,380 --> 10:56:07,780
including desalination plants.

9537
10:56:07,780 --> 10:56:10,580
24 hours after that wave of attacks,

9538
10:56:10,620 --> 10:56:15,980
what's the damage assessment?

9539
10:56:15,980 --> 10:56:19,060
Well, authorities here are still assessing the damage.

9540
10:56:19,060 --> 10:56:23,580
I mean, numerous, several locations in Kuwait were hit.

9541
10:56:23,580 --> 10:56:27,140
You know, two power and water desalination plants.

9542
10:56:27,140 --> 10:56:29,900
One next to the Ezur desalination plant,

9543
10:56:29,900 --> 10:56:33,060
that's one of the biggest in the Middle East.

9544
10:56:33,060 --> 10:56:36,420
You know, desalination is extremely important

9545
10:56:36,420 --> 10:56:39,020
for the Gulf, but here in Kuwait, more so.

9546
10:56:39,020 --> 10:56:41,380
You know, there's eight desalination plants.

9547
10:56:41,380 --> 10:56:43,820
More than 90% of the drinking water

9548
10:56:43,820 --> 10:56:46,540
comes from these plants, so it's extremely important.

9549
10:56:46,540 --> 10:56:48,260
I think for Kuwait officials, you know,

9550
10:56:48,260 --> 10:56:51,260
the water infrastructure is a red line

9551
10:56:51,260 --> 10:56:53,300
and that continues to be crossed.

9552
10:56:53,300 --> 10:56:56,140
But we also saw, you know, according to authorities,

9553
10:56:56,140 --> 10:56:58,740
fires where several fires broke out

9554
10:56:58,740 --> 10:57:03,380
at the petrochemical company, as well as oil facilities.

9555
10:57:03,380 --> 10:57:05,380
We saw two power generation units

9556
10:57:05,380 --> 10:57:07,580
being taken off the grid.

9557
10:57:07,580 --> 10:57:10,460
A finance ministry building was hit.

9558
10:57:10,660 --> 10:57:14,580
Also, the Kuwaiti Petroleum Company headquarters was hit.

9559
10:57:14,580 --> 10:57:17,580
You know, the ministerial complex here in Kuwait

9560
10:57:17,580 --> 10:57:19,420
and houses 19 buildings.

9561
10:57:19,420 --> 10:57:20,700
You know, there's the Ministry of Labor,

9562
10:57:20,700 --> 10:57:24,020
the Ministry of Social Affairs, the Ministry of Finance,

9563
10:57:24,020 --> 10:57:27,900
and various, you know, very important government institutions.

9564
10:57:27,900 --> 10:57:30,700
They've told employees not to show up to work,

9565
10:57:30,700 --> 10:57:32,620
to work remotely.

9566
10:57:32,620 --> 10:57:35,100
I think here in Kuwait, you know,

9567
10:57:35,100 --> 10:57:37,380
what we've seen in the last couple of weeks

9568
10:57:37,420 --> 10:57:40,140
is that these Iranian drones have been able

9569
10:57:40,140 --> 10:57:42,780
to circumvent their air defense system.

9570
10:57:42,780 --> 10:57:45,980
So as this, you know, looming deadline approaches,

9571
10:57:45,980 --> 10:57:48,700
people here become extremely worried.

9572
10:57:48,700 --> 10:57:52,860
You know, the Kuwait is the closest country to Iran.

9573
10:57:52,860 --> 10:57:56,140
Only 80 kilometers of water is what separates it.

9574
10:57:56,140 --> 10:57:58,500
So, you know, on a geographical standpoint,

9575
10:57:58,500 --> 10:58:01,820
it's the most easily targeted, you know.

9576
10:58:01,820 --> 10:58:03,900
And it also borders Iraq,

9577
10:58:03,900 --> 10:58:06,860
where officials have been saying for the last week or so

9578
10:58:06,860 --> 10:58:09,340
that a lot of these drones or attacks

9579
10:58:09,340 --> 10:58:12,380
are coming from Iranian factions,

9580
10:58:12,380 --> 10:58:14,380
Iranian allied factions from Iraq.

9581
10:58:14,380 --> 10:58:17,620
So, you know, people here become extremely worried.

9582
10:58:17,620 --> 10:58:19,820
And when President Trump says that, you know,

9583
10:58:19,820 --> 10:58:23,220
he's gonna let the gates of hell lose,

9584
10:58:23,220 --> 10:58:27,340
obliterate power and water infrastructure,

9585
10:58:27,340 --> 10:58:31,660
what we've consistently seen is Iran attacks the Gulf.

9586
10:58:31,660 --> 10:58:33,980
So I think, you know, the main objective

9587
10:58:33,980 --> 10:58:35,820
for Gulf countries right now

9588
10:58:35,820 --> 10:58:38,020
is to try to de-escalate the situation.

9589
10:58:38,020 --> 10:58:39,660
They've said from the beginning

9590
10:58:39,660 --> 10:58:43,100
that, you know, there's no military solution here.

9591
10:58:43,100 --> 10:58:45,020
Let's de-escalate the situation.

9592
10:58:45,020 --> 10:58:48,940
Let's find a diplomatic path towards ending this war

9593
10:58:48,940 --> 10:58:51,950
and bringing long-term stability.

9594
10:58:51,950 --> 10:58:54,150
Malik Trina reporting from Kuwait City.

9595
10:58:54,150 --> 10:58:56,380
Thank you very much, Malik.

9596
10:58:56,380 --> 10:58:59,100
And US President Donald Trump has been giving Iran

9597
10:58:59,100 --> 10:59:01,740
shifting deadlines to reopen the Strait of Hormuz.

9598
10:59:01,740 --> 10:59:03,340
That is, as Iran insists

9599
10:59:03,340 --> 10:59:06,140
that the key waterway isn't actually closed

9600
10:59:06,140 --> 10:59:08,700
and that only ships that belong to its enemies

9601
10:59:08,700 --> 10:59:10,660
are barred from passage.

9602
10:59:10,660 --> 10:59:13,860
Trump issued his first ultimatum on March 21st.

9603
10:59:13,860 --> 10:59:15,740
He threatened to bomb Iran's power plants

9604
10:59:15,740 --> 10:59:18,740
if the Strait wasn't reopened within 48 hours.

9605
10:59:18,740 --> 10:59:20,980
But he later extended that deadline by five days,

9606
10:59:20,980 --> 10:59:24,780
claiming that negotiations were underway and going well.

9607
10:59:24,780 --> 10:59:28,060
And Trump issued then a new deadline on March 26th

9608
10:59:28,060 --> 10:59:29,780
and he gave Iran 10 days.

9609
10:59:29,780 --> 10:59:31,420
So that was the second extension.

9610
10:59:31,420 --> 10:59:35,250
Or until the evening of April 6th to reopen the Strait.

9611
10:59:35,250 --> 10:59:38,330
Trump issued his latest Hormuz threat on Sunday.

9612
10:59:38,330 --> 10:59:40,730
After vowing to bomb power plants and bridges

9613
10:59:40,730 --> 10:59:42,250
if Tehran does not comply,

9614
10:59:42,250 --> 10:59:44,690
he posted what appears to be a Tuesday,

9615
10:59:44,690 --> 10:59:49,210
8 p.m. Eastern time deadline for a deal to be made

9616
10:59:49,210 --> 10:59:51,610
or the Strait to be reopened.

9617
10:59:51,610 --> 10:59:52,890
Michael Shubridge is the Director

9618
10:59:52,890 --> 10:59:54,450
of Strategic Analysis Australia.

9619
10:59:54,450 --> 10:59:56,290
That is a defense and security think tank.

9620
10:59:56,290 --> 10:59:58,170
He's in Moruya in Australia.

9621
10:59:58,170 --> 11:00:00,490
Michael, it's good to have you on the program.

9622
11:00:00,000 --> 11:00:05,000
We appear to see two opposing beliefs here.

9623
11:00:05,520 --> 11:00:09,080
The US belief that they can ultimately bomb Iran

9624
11:00:09,080 --> 11:00:11,200
into changing their behavior.

9625
11:00:11,200 --> 11:00:13,480
And the Iranian belief, apparently,

9626
11:00:13,480 --> 11:00:16,000
that holding and controlling the Strait of Hormuz

9627
11:00:16,000 --> 11:00:18,960
actually puts them in a dominant position,

9628
11:00:18,960 --> 11:00:21,080
gives them more leverage than the entire

9629
11:00:21,080 --> 11:00:23,980
military capability of the United States.

9630
11:00:23,980 --> 11:00:27,280
Those two things, completely contradictory ideas,

9631
11:00:27,280 --> 11:00:28,600
they don't meet in the middle.

9632
11:00:28,600 --> 11:00:32,220
So where does that take us?

9633
11:00:32,220 --> 11:00:33,620
Well, Cyril, I think you're right

9634
11:00:33,620 --> 11:00:36,980
to lay out those two very different perspectives.

9635
11:00:36,980 --> 11:00:39,260
And that's what President Trump

9636
11:00:39,260 --> 11:00:43,380
seems to be finding so jarring and difficult.

9637
11:00:43,380 --> 11:00:46,560
He thought that overwhelming military power

9638
11:00:46,560 --> 11:00:49,280
from Israel and America would cause

9639
11:00:49,280 --> 11:00:52,820
the Iranian regime to fold and meet his demands.

9640
11:00:52,820 --> 11:00:54,900
That just hasn't happened.

9641
11:00:54,900 --> 11:00:58,640
And as the war has gone on through weeks,

9642
11:00:58,640 --> 11:01:00,760
the Americans and Israelis keep trying

9643
11:01:00,760 --> 11:01:03,160
to do the same thing, but more of it,

9644
11:01:03,160 --> 11:01:06,640
more bombing and damage to military and government sites,

9645
11:01:06,640 --> 11:01:08,880
and expect a different result.

9646
11:01:08,880 --> 11:01:09,880
That isn't happening.

9647
11:01:09,880 --> 11:01:13,140
So right now, the leverage is with Iran.

9648
11:01:14,320 --> 11:01:16,400
So you say, that was gonna be my next question,

9649
11:01:16,400 --> 11:01:18,160
that the US and Israel continue to bomb,

9650
11:01:18,160 --> 11:01:20,980
hoping that what hasn't yet happened,

9651
11:01:20,980 --> 11:01:22,860
in other words, Iran changing its behavior,

9652
11:01:22,860 --> 11:01:26,140
Iran conceding, or Iran even capitulating,

9653
11:01:26,140 --> 11:01:29,020
it hasn't yet happened, but they believe or hope

9654
11:01:29,020 --> 11:01:30,940
that maybe it will happen.

9655
11:01:30,940 --> 11:01:35,080
Do you think that it can?

9656
11:01:35,080 --> 11:01:38,540
No, I don't, because I think doubling down

9657
11:01:38,540 --> 11:01:40,720
on this failing course of action

9658
11:01:40,720 --> 11:01:44,540
by the Americans and Israelis is not gonna change

9659
11:01:44,540 --> 11:01:48,720
the fact that the Iranians have sufficient military power

9660
11:01:48,720 --> 11:01:50,360
to keep the strait closed

9661
11:01:50,360 --> 11:01:53,200
to those that doesn't want to pass the strait,

9662
11:01:53,200 --> 11:01:55,640
and to attack the broader infrastructure

9663
11:01:55,680 --> 11:01:58,480
of the Gulf States and Israel.

9664
11:01:58,480 --> 11:02:00,720
So that my real concern now,

9665
11:02:00,720 --> 11:02:05,720
is unless these very uncertain, strange negotiations

9666
11:02:06,200 --> 11:02:09,680
around a ceasefire somehow come to fruit,

9667
11:02:09,680 --> 11:02:13,120
we will see the escalation from America and Israel

9668
11:02:13,120 --> 11:02:16,720
to destroy more civilian infrastructure in Iran,

9669
11:02:16,720 --> 11:02:19,240
and Iran will reciprocate by damaging

9670
11:02:19,240 --> 11:02:22,200
even more civilian infrastructure across the Gulf.

9671
11:02:22,200 --> 11:02:23,720
From a defense standpoint,

9672
11:02:23,720 --> 11:02:27,560
I wonder how you analyze the fact that the U.S. and Israel,

9673
11:02:27,560 --> 11:02:29,080
specifically the U.S., actually,

9674
11:02:29,080 --> 11:02:31,600
has been saying for weeks that they are this close

9675
11:02:31,600 --> 11:02:34,120
to getting rid of all of Iran's missiles and drones

9676
11:02:34,120 --> 11:02:36,680
and missile and drone building capability.

9677
11:02:36,680 --> 11:02:38,600
They've been saying this for weeks,

9678
11:02:38,600 --> 11:02:41,420
and yet Iran is still able to fire missiles and drones.

9679
11:02:41,420 --> 11:02:46,190
How does that make sense from a defense standpoint?

9680
11:02:46,190 --> 11:02:48,870
Well, because the American assessments

9681
11:02:48,870 --> 11:02:51,510
aren't founded on good information,

9682
11:02:51,510 --> 11:02:53,730
and they don't seem to have taken account

9683
11:02:53,730 --> 11:02:56,210
of very recent experience.

9684
11:02:56,210 --> 11:02:59,150
So why is Israel now doing a major ground invasion

9685
11:02:59,150 --> 11:03:00,610
of Lebanon?

9686
11:03:00,610 --> 11:03:04,090
Just a year ago, we were told that completely destroyed

9687
11:03:04,090 --> 11:03:07,170
Hezbollah's leadership and their capacity

9688
11:03:07,170 --> 11:03:10,850
to launch rockets and drones against Israel.

9689
11:03:10,850 --> 11:03:12,290
And then we heard from the Israelis,

9690
11:03:12,290 --> 11:03:15,490
well, Hezbollah had unexpectedly, rapidly rebuilt

9691
11:03:15,490 --> 11:03:18,370
its leadership and missile and drone capabilities.

9692
11:03:18,370 --> 11:03:23,090
Well, Iran is able to do that on a much bigger scale.

9693
11:03:23,090 --> 11:03:25,330
And the Houthis are another good example.

9694
11:03:25,330 --> 11:03:27,530
So it's no surprise, I would think,

9695
11:03:27,530 --> 11:03:30,250
to many people in the U.S. intelligence community

9696
11:03:30,250 --> 11:03:33,610
that Iran can still keep launching missiles and drones.

9697
11:03:33,610 --> 11:03:36,810
It just seems not to have percolated into the White House.

9698
11:03:36,810 --> 11:03:39,450
Okay, well, Michael, sorry to allow me to insist,

9699
11:03:39,450 --> 11:03:40,810
because you're saying it's no surprise

9700
11:03:40,810 --> 11:03:42,810
to many people in the intelligence community.

9701
11:03:42,810 --> 11:03:44,170
But what you're also telling us

9702
11:03:44,170 --> 11:03:47,170
is that both Israel and the United States,

9703
11:03:47,170 --> 11:03:49,610
we're talking about the most formidable

9704
11:03:49,610 --> 11:03:52,530
military force in the world.

9705
11:03:52,530 --> 11:03:54,770
You're saying they went into this war

9706
11:03:54,770 --> 11:03:58,090
with a completely false assessment

9707
11:03:58,090 --> 11:04:01,750
of their enemy's capabilities.

9708
11:04:01,750 --> 11:04:02,990
Yes, I am.

9709
11:04:02,990 --> 11:04:07,990
And I think, well, Israel, I'm not sure, had that delusion.

9710
11:04:09,190 --> 11:04:12,150
I think the Israeli plan is really to weaken

9711
11:04:12,150 --> 11:04:14,430
Iran as much as possible

9712
11:04:14,430 --> 11:04:17,150
and they're happy to have the Americans helping.

9713
11:04:17,150 --> 11:04:22,150
So this looks more like what Israel likes to see,

9714
11:04:22,350 --> 11:04:24,270
but I think there's no doubt

9715
11:04:24,270 --> 11:04:27,870
that the American government is surprised

9716
11:04:27,870 --> 11:04:30,550
in a way that they simply shouldn't be.

9717
11:04:30,550 --> 11:04:32,110
So in that case, I circle back

9718
11:04:32,110 --> 11:04:34,190
to something similar to my first question,

9719
11:04:34,190 --> 11:04:37,630
which is if the U.S. belief is we can bomb them

9720
11:04:37,630 --> 11:04:39,390
and somehow change the situation.

9721
11:04:39,390 --> 11:04:41,670
And if you're telling us, actually, no,

9722
11:04:41,670 --> 11:04:43,710
their information is wrong, their assumption,

9723
11:04:43,710 --> 11:04:45,270
their base assumption for this war

9724
11:04:45,270 --> 11:04:47,870
on the American side is wrong,

9725
11:04:47,870 --> 11:04:50,350
then what happens next?

9726
11:04:50,350 --> 11:04:52,470
Because if they keep bombing and nothing changes,

9727
11:04:52,470 --> 11:04:53,550
surely at some point,

9728
11:04:53,550 --> 11:04:55,390
that information to use your words

9729
11:04:55,390 --> 11:04:59,520
will percolate up to the White House.

9730
11:04:59,520 --> 11:05:02,960
Well, only after a lot of other damage has been done.

9731
11:05:02,960 --> 11:05:07,960
So it looks to me with these increasingly angry,

9732
11:05:07,960 --> 11:05:11,080
frustrated, incoherent messages

9733
11:05:11,080 --> 11:05:12,680
coming out of President Trump

9734
11:05:12,680 --> 11:05:15,160
at all hours of the day and night

9735
11:05:15,160 --> 11:05:18,480
that he wants to double down

9736
11:05:18,480 --> 11:05:22,120
because at the moment it's an embarrassment.

9737
11:05:22,120 --> 11:05:25,800
And so destroying broader infrastructure in Iran

9738
11:05:25,800 --> 11:05:29,880
or doing something symbolic like seizing Karg Island

9739
11:05:29,880 --> 11:05:32,680
may then let him change the story,

9740
11:05:32,680 --> 11:05:35,870
but it doesn't change how the war's going.

9741
11:05:35,870 --> 11:05:37,390
Michael Shubridge, thank you very much

9742
11:05:37,390 --> 11:05:42,020
for joining us on the program.

9743
11:05:42,020 --> 11:05:44,140
And Israel has carried out multiple strikes

9744
11:05:44,140 --> 11:05:46,380
across Southern Lebanon and the capital, Beirut,

9745
11:05:46,380 --> 11:05:48,980
causing widespread damage and death.

9746
11:05:48,980 --> 11:05:51,380
Israeli military attacks targeted multiple areas

9747
11:05:51,380 --> 11:05:53,740
in the Nabata district in the south.

9748
11:05:53,740 --> 11:05:55,140
At least four people were killed

9749
11:05:55,140 --> 11:05:57,020
in a drone strike targeting a car.

9750
11:05:57,020 --> 11:05:59,540
And in a separate attack in the same area,

9751
11:05:59,540 --> 11:06:01,540
one person was killed.

9752
11:06:01,540 --> 11:06:03,940
Overnight, the Israeli military targeted an apartment

9753
11:06:03,940 --> 11:06:06,140
east of Beirut, killing at least three people

9754
11:06:06,140 --> 11:06:07,500
in the southern suburbs.

9755
11:06:07,500 --> 11:06:09,580
Strikes on a densely populated area

9756
11:06:09,580 --> 11:06:11,620
killed five people on Sunday.

9757
11:06:11,620 --> 11:06:13,420
Israeli attacks across Lebanon

9758
11:06:13,420 --> 11:06:15,780
have killed more than 1,300 people.

9759
11:06:15,780 --> 11:06:18,460
That is according to the Lebanese health ministry.

9760
11:06:18,460 --> 11:06:20,380
Let's bring in Al-Jazeera Zain al-Khodr.

9761
11:06:20,380 --> 11:06:21,580
You're in the capital, Zain al-Khodr.

9762
11:06:21,580 --> 11:06:29,460
What more can you tell us about that attack in Beirut?

9763
11:06:29,460 --> 11:06:31,940
Civilians are increasingly being caught up

9764
11:06:31,940 --> 11:06:33,020
in this conflict.

9765
11:06:33,020 --> 11:06:34,860
The attack in Beirut on Sunday.

9766
11:06:34,860 --> 11:06:35,940
There were two.

9767
11:06:35,940 --> 11:06:38,340
One in the district of Znech.

9768
11:06:38,340 --> 11:06:39,860
Five people were killed.

9769
11:06:39,860 --> 11:06:44,860
Three Sudanese nationals, a 15-year-old child,

9770
11:06:44,940 --> 11:06:49,060
and the apparent target, a Hezbollah military commander.

9771
11:06:49,060 --> 11:06:52,460
So even in the so-called targeted assassination,

9772
11:06:52,460 --> 11:06:54,060
civilians are being killed.

9773
11:06:54,060 --> 11:06:57,380
In another strike in Beirut last night in Ain Sa'adi,

9774
11:06:57,380 --> 11:07:00,900
that's a district north of Beirut,

9775
11:07:00,900 --> 11:07:02,820
three people were killed.

9776
11:07:02,820 --> 11:07:05,380
The missile targeted the third floor of the building

9777
11:07:05,380 --> 11:07:08,420
and these civilians were on the second floor

9778
11:07:08,420 --> 11:07:09,860
of the building.

9779
11:07:09,860 --> 11:07:13,940
The Lebanese health ministry saying that 1,461 people

9780
11:07:13,940 --> 11:07:16,860
have been killed, 4,000 people wounded.

9781
11:07:16,860 --> 11:07:20,420
That doesn't include the latest casualties this morning

9782
11:07:20,420 --> 11:07:22,260
in Mashkhara, that's in West Bikar,

9783
11:07:22,260 --> 11:07:23,660
three people killed.

9784
11:07:23,660 --> 11:07:25,620
In Farouman, a car was hit,

9785
11:07:25,620 --> 11:07:27,940
that's in the Nabati district in South Lebanon,

9786
11:07:27,940 --> 11:07:29,060
four people killed.

9787
11:07:29,060 --> 11:07:32,460
There was another strike in Nabati, another person killed.

9788
11:07:32,460 --> 11:07:34,940
So the death toll keeps climbing

9789
11:07:34,940 --> 11:07:37,980
and this conflict is in its sixth week.

9790
11:07:37,980 --> 11:07:39,980
The Lebanese health ministry and its figures,

9791
11:07:39,980 --> 11:07:42,220
it doesn't differentiate between combatants

9792
11:07:42,220 --> 11:07:45,580
and civilians, but if you count the number of women,

9793
11:07:45,580 --> 11:07:49,660
children, paramedics, that's roughly 25%.

9794
11:07:49,660 --> 11:07:51,660
So there is increasing concern

9795
11:07:51,780 --> 11:07:54,460
because this conflict really has no red line.

9796
11:07:54,460 --> 11:07:58,780
Even though Israel may want to target a specific Hezbollah,

9797
11:07:58,780 --> 11:08:01,380
a member, it doesn't really matter

9798
11:08:01,380 --> 11:08:05,110
if that member is an intensely populated area.

9799
11:08:05,110 --> 11:08:07,870
Zayna, I know it is difficult to make out precisely

9800
11:08:07,870 --> 11:08:09,910
how the war in the southern part of the country

9801
11:08:09,910 --> 11:08:11,590
is going, Southern Lebanon,

9802
11:08:11,590 --> 11:08:13,830
but what are you able to tell us?

9803
11:08:13,830 --> 11:08:16,030
We understand Israel continues to push

9804
11:08:16,030 --> 11:08:18,070
a little further into the country,

9805
11:08:18,070 --> 11:08:20,030
but we also understand that they are met

9806
11:08:20,030 --> 11:08:22,630
with what I think is fierce resistance

9807
11:08:22,630 --> 11:08:27,870
from Hezbollah fighters.

9808
11:08:27,870 --> 11:08:30,590
No doubt, yes, there has been fierce resistance.

9809
11:08:30,590 --> 11:08:33,190
Hezbollah trying to slow that advance

9810
11:08:33,190 --> 11:08:37,750
and in fact, in the past 48 hours, it has been slowed.

9811
11:08:37,750 --> 11:08:40,350
The Israeli military now focusing on trying

9812
11:08:40,350 --> 11:08:42,910
to besiege the southern town of Bintish Bayle,

9813
11:08:42,910 --> 11:08:44,510
which is a few kilometers from the border

9814
11:08:44,510 --> 11:08:46,790
in the central sector of South Lebanon,

9815
11:08:46,790 --> 11:08:48,230
a very strategic town,

9816
11:08:48,230 --> 11:08:50,670
trying to cut the supply lines to this town.

9817
11:08:50,670 --> 11:08:52,350
It also has a symbolic value

9818
11:08:52,350 --> 11:08:54,750
because it's known as in Lebanon

9819
11:08:54,750 --> 11:08:57,350
as the capital of the resistance.

9820
11:08:57,350 --> 11:09:01,230
So, yes, that invasion has been slowed down,

9821
11:09:01,230 --> 11:09:04,870
Israel facing obstacles with the Israeli army chief

9822
11:09:04,870 --> 11:09:07,910
saying that while the ultimate objective of Israel

9823
11:09:07,910 --> 11:09:09,510
is to disarm Hezbollah,

9824
11:09:09,510 --> 11:09:11,550
the objective of the current campaign

9825
11:09:11,550 --> 11:09:13,390
is to advance that objective.

9826
11:09:13,390 --> 11:09:16,350
He's not even talking about achieving that objective,

9827
11:09:16,350 --> 11:09:18,310
but advancing that objective.

9828
11:09:18,310 --> 11:09:20,310
The Israeli army is under no illusion

9829
11:09:20,310 --> 11:09:22,870
that even if you reach the Littani River,

9830
11:09:22,870 --> 11:09:25,510
it doesn't mean you disarm Hezbollah.

9831
11:09:25,510 --> 11:09:27,150
Hezbollah's strategic weapons,

9832
11:09:27,150 --> 11:09:28,430
it's long-range missiles,

9833
11:09:28,430 --> 11:09:29,710
they're in the east of the country,

9834
11:09:29,710 --> 11:09:31,630
in the Bekaa, in the Baalbek region.

9835
11:09:31,630 --> 11:09:32,870
Over the past two years,

9836
11:09:32,870 --> 11:09:35,390
we've reported repeatedly about airstrikes

9837
11:09:35,390 --> 11:09:36,630
targeting those regions

9838
11:09:36,630 --> 11:09:41,020
and yet we see Hezbollah launching those rockets.

9839
11:09:41,020 --> 11:09:43,580
Zeina Hodor reporting from the Lebanese capital Beirut.

9840
11:09:43,580 --> 11:09:46,160
Thank you very much, Zeina.

9841
11:09:46,160 --> 11:09:48,320
In the Gaza Strip now, Hamas says

9842
11:09:48,320 --> 11:09:50,800
that it will not hand over its weapons.

9843
11:09:50,800 --> 11:09:52,840
Disarmament is part of the second phase

9844
11:09:52,840 --> 11:09:54,280
