9845
11:09:54,280 --> 11:09:56,200
That's the phase that we're currently in,

9846
11:09:56,200 --> 11:09:57,840
but the armed group says

9847
11:09:57,840 --> 11:10:00,640
that calls to lay down its weapons are unacceptable,

9848
11:10:00,640 --> 11:10:02,240
especially as Palestinians continue

9849
11:10:02,240 --> 11:10:03,920
to be targeted by Israel.

9850
11:10:03,920 --> 11:10:05,600
More than 700 have been killed

9851
11:10:05,600 --> 11:10:08,820
since the cease-fire came into effect in October.

9852
11:10:08,820 --> 11:10:12,900
As for raising the issue of weapons

9853
11:10:12,900 --> 11:10:14,100
in this crude manner,

9854
11:10:14,100 --> 11:10:16,100
it is nothing but a scandalous attempt

9855
11:10:16,100 --> 11:10:18,180
by the occupation to continue killing

9856
11:10:18,180 --> 11:10:20,300
and genocide against our people,

9857
11:10:20,300 --> 11:10:23,620
which we will not accept under any circumstances.

9858
11:10:23,620 --> 11:10:26,460
We affirm that what the enemy was unable to seize from us

9859
11:10:26,460 --> 11:10:28,220
with tanks and genocide,

9860
11:10:28,220 --> 11:10:30,380
it will not seize from us with politics

9861
11:10:30,380 --> 11:10:32,700
or at the negotiation table.

9862
11:10:32,700 --> 11:10:34,860
The occupation's aggression against our people

9863
11:10:34,860 --> 11:10:37,660
and its continued closure of the blessed al-Aqsa mosque

9864
11:10:37,660 --> 11:10:40,100
to worshipers in an unprecedented manner

9865
11:10:40,100 --> 11:10:41,460
and the approval of the law

9866
11:10:41,460 --> 11:10:43,580
for executing Palestinian prisoners,

9867
11:10:43,580 --> 11:10:45,860
we call upon the masses of our Palestinian people

9868
11:10:45,860 --> 11:10:47,140
in the brave West Bank,

9869
11:10:47,140 --> 11:10:49,780
the blessed Jerusalem and the occupied interior

9870
11:10:49,780 --> 11:10:53,080
to march toward al-Aqsa mosque.

9871
11:10:53,080 --> 11:10:57,560
Ukraine has struck a coal mine in Russian-controlled Luhansk,

9872
11:10:57,560 --> 11:10:59,120
damaging a power substation

9873
11:10:59,120 --> 11:11:01,440
and trapping 41 workers underground.

9874
11:11:01,440 --> 11:11:03,520
That is according to a Russian-installed official

9875
11:11:03,520 --> 11:11:04,680
in the region.

9876
11:11:04,680 --> 11:11:07,080
Leonid Pazashnik said emergency crews

9877
11:11:07,080 --> 11:11:08,560
are working to rescue the miners

9878
11:11:08,560 --> 11:11:10,360
and restore power to the site.

9879
11:11:10,360 --> 11:11:14,680
He said the miners have a supply of drinking water.

9880
11:11:14,680 --> 11:11:16,640
Four astronauts are hours away

9881
11:11:16,640 --> 11:11:18,280
from becoming the first people

9882
11:11:18,280 --> 11:11:29,200
to see the dark side of the moon with their own eyes.

9883
11:11:29,200 --> 11:11:31,640
So the four crew members of the Artemis II mission

9884
11:11:31,640 --> 11:11:33,120
have entered the final run-up

9885
11:11:33,120 --> 11:11:35,560
to a loop around the back of the moon.

9886
11:11:35,560 --> 11:11:37,120
At this point, the moon's gravity

9887
11:11:37,120 --> 11:11:38,960
has a stronger pull on the capsule

9888
11:11:38,960 --> 11:11:41,760
that they're traveling on than Earth's gravity.

9889
11:11:41,760 --> 11:11:43,640
The three Americans and one Canadian

9890
11:11:43,640 --> 11:11:46,480
will travel further from Earth than any human

9891
11:11:46,480 --> 11:11:49,720
when they complete the first crewed lunar fly-by

9892
11:11:49,720 --> 11:11:51,440
in more than 50 years.

9893
11:11:51,440 --> 11:11:53,880
They will lose communications for about 40 minutes

9894
11:11:53,880 --> 11:11:55,160
while they're behind the moon,

9895
11:11:55,160 --> 11:11:58,000
but they will also be witnessing a solar...

