11:12:07,700 --> 11:12:10,860
As the US-Israel war on Iran rages on,

9900
11:12:10,860 --> 11:12:14,620
its impact has spread far beyond the battlefield.

9901
11:12:14,620 --> 11:12:16,300
Energy prices are soaring

9902
11:12:16,300 --> 11:12:20,080
