9910
11:12:36,960 --> 11:12:39,600
In-depth analysis of the day's headlines.

9911
11:12:39,600 --> 11:12:43,800
Diplomacy yet again was used as a ruse for war.

9912
11:12:43,800 --> 11:12:44,840
Critical debate.

9913
11:12:44,840 --> 11:12:46,160
Who betrayed the table?

9914
11:12:46,160 --> 11:12:48,960
Who attacked the negotiations for the second time?

9915
11:12:48,960 --> 11:12:50,080
For the third time,

9916
11:12:50,080 --> 11:12:51,960
during the talks we should be attacked,

9917
11:12:51,960 --> 11:12:54,920
who is talking about a greater country for itself?

9918
11:12:54,920 --> 11:12:56,160
Israel, not Iran.

9919
11:12:56,160 --> 11:13:00,080
Iran has been a huge supporter of terrorism over the years.

9920
11:13:00,120 --> 11:13:02,360
I really have to take exception to the idea

9921
11:13:02,360 --> 11:13:04,320
